   <body>
      <p>You can change the interface language of the SMS web application to any of the following:</p>
      <ul id="ul_103141165">
         <li>English (EN)</li>
         <li>Spanish (ES)</li>
         <li>German (DE)</li>
         <li>French (FR)</li>
         <li>Japanese (JA)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The SMS mobile app supports all the above languages except German.</p>
   </body>
